+# Locker remediation consumer validation
+
+This isolated checkout validates the reviewed Locker library and minimal consumer compatibility changes. It does not deploy a service or externally release any dependency. The original Fullhouse and Social checkouts were not edited or built by this task.
+
+## Immutable inputs
+
+Fullhouse base: `1d5a23f`, branch `fix/lockers-review-consumer`. All resolution uses the explicitly configured ignored `.fh/workspace.json`, an immutable frozen `.fh/dependencies-lockers-recovery-consumer-final.json`, and this checkout's isolated `.fh/maven`. Global Maven Local is not consulted.
