+## Consumer changes and evidence
+
+Public port8080 mounts client Locker routes. Internal port8081 mounts admin routes and peer routes authenticated with the configured shared peer token. Claim ownership requires an internal advertised address and peer credential. Test services use the explicit test-only all-services helper. CORS exposes the exact RPC status header.
